@startuml delete-manager-admin-account-pk
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title DELETE /api/manager/v1/admin-account/{pk}
caption CRB-35 · 어드민 계정 삭제 (superadmin 전용, 자기 자신 · superadmin은 불가)

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard\n+ SuperAdminGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "AdminAccountController" as Controller
participant "AdminAccountService" as Service
participant "AdminAccountRepository" as AdminAccountRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: DELETE /api/manager/v1/admin-account/{pk}\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard + SuperAdminGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found\n403 Superadmin privilege is required.
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt pk가 UUID가 아님
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (ParseUUIDPipe 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: remove(pk, manager)
Controller -> Service: remove(pk, manager)
Service -> AdminAccountRepository: findByPk(pk)
AdminAccountRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT admin_account WHERE pk = ?
PostgreSQL --> AdminAccountRepository: row
alt 계정 없음
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 Admin account not found.
end
alt 대상이 나 자신
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 403 You cannot remove yourself.
else 대상이 superadmin
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 403 Superadmin accounts cannot be removed. Demote to admin first.
end
Service -> AdminAccountRepository: deleteAdminByPk(pk)
AdminAccountRepository -> PostgreSQL: DELETE admin_account\nWHERE pk = ? AND role = 'admin' RETURNING
note right: 확인과 삭제 사이에 superadmin으로 승격돼도 지우지 않음
PostgreSQL --> AdminAccountRepository: row | 0행
alt 0행 (그 사이 승격 또는 삭제됨)
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 403 Superadmin accounts cannot be removed. Demote to admin first.
end
note right of Service
  대상이 가진 토큰은 다음 요청부터 401 Manager not found.
  admin_account를 참조하는 FK 없음
end note
Service --> Controller: BaseResultDto.OK
Controller --> Client: 200 { result: "OK" }

@enduml
